## Linting Expectations

**Why:** Run the same linters that CI runs so lint/format issues are fixed before push and don’t cause long-tail CI failures.

### Python
- Run Ruff on changed Python code before considering a task complete.
- When Pylint is configured, run Pylint on changed code as well.

### TypeScript / React (`_vendor/figma_make/`)
- Run the TypeScript linter on changed TS/TSX code in the dashboard before considering a task complete.
- From project root: `npm run lint --prefix _vendor/figma_make` (or `cd _vendor/figma_make && npm run lint`).
- To auto-fix: `npm run lint:fix --prefix _vendor/figma_make` (or `cd _vendor/figma_make && npm run lint:fix`).
- Uses ESLint with typescript-eslint and React/React Hooks rules; config lives at `_vendor/figma_make/eslint.config.js`.

### General
- Fix any lint findings, or explicitly document why a finding is intentionally ignored.
